#: Survey/MySurvey.cpp:37
msgid ""
"<p>This is the KPhotoAlbum survey. Its goal is to collect the information "
"needed to make KPhotoAlbum meet the needs of users like you.</p><p>Spend a "
"couple of minutes and share your experience of using KPhotoAlbum.</p><p>At "
"any time, you can quit the survey and return to it later on; it will "
"remember your previous answers.</p><p align=\"right\">Thanks in advance! "
"Jesper</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is de KPhotoAlbum-Ünnersöken. De Informatschonen warrt sammelt, "
"dormit ik KPhotoAlbum beter op de Mögen vun Brukers jüst as Di topassen kann."
"</p><p>Nimm Di bitte en poor Minuten Tiet un vertell wat över Dien Beleven "
"vun KPhotoAlbum.</p><p>Du kannst de Ünnersöken jümmers beennen un later "
"wiedermaken, Dien Antwoorden warrt wohrt.</p><p align=\"right\">Dank ok al "
"vörweg - Jesper</p>"

